  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 cup butter",
    "1/2 cup pumpkin puree",
    "4 ounce cream cheese",
    "1/4 cup powdered erythritol",
    "2 teaspoon pumpkin pie spice",
    "1/2 cup pecans"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Let your butter and cream cheese get to room temp, or melt in the microwave if it’s not soft to the touch.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pumpkin-pie-fat-bombs/#wprm-recipe-53385-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Pumpkin-pie-bite-fat-bombs-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine the pumpkin puree, butter, and cream cheese together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pumpkin-pie-fat-bombs/#wprm-recipe-53385-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Pumpkin-pie-bite-fat-bombs-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once a mixture is formed, add the powdered erythritol and pumpkin pie spice. Mix together until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pumpkin-pie-fat-bombs/#wprm-recipe-53385-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Pumpkin-pie-bite-fat-bombs-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the mixture into an ice cube tray or candy molds of your choice.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pumpkin-pie-fat-bombs/#wprm-recipe-53385-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Pumpkin-pie-bite-fat-bombs-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Optionally toast up the pecans in an oven at 350F for 8-10 minutes, or toast in a pan over medium heat until fragrant.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pumpkin-pie-fat-bombs/#wprm-recipe-53385-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Pumpkin-pie-bite-fat-bombs-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top the fat bombs with the chopped pecans and press gently.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pumpkin-pie-fat-bombs/#wprm-recipe-53385-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Pumpkin-pie-bite-fat-bombs-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put in the fridge or freezer until set and can be removed from molds.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pumpkin-pie-fat-bombs/#wprm-recipe-53385-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
